  {
    school: 'XLRI Jamshedpur (PGDM-BM and PGDM-HRM)',
    stance: 'No mandatory experience, freshers welcome',
    reality: 'XLRI does not set an age limit or a work-experience floor for its Business Management and HR Management programs, and freshers typically make up 15-20% of these batches. The separate PGDM-GM (General Management) track is a different story — see below.',
  },
  {
    school: 'MDI Gurgaon',
    stance: 'No mandatory experience, but leans experienced',
    reality: 'MDI does not require prior work experience on paper, but its average incoming work experience sits around 26 months, among the higher averages outside ISB — a signal that experienced applicants are competing hard for the same seats.',
  },
  {
    school: 'Newer and fresher-leaning IIMs',
    stance: 'Genuinely built for freshers',
    reality: 'IIM Ranchi (average 9 months experience), IMT Ghaziabad (10 months), MICA and DSE (12 months), and IRMA Anand (6 months) run batches where freshers are the norm, not the exception. Cutoffs here are also lower than the top-3 IIMs, which is the trade a fresher makes for an easier entry.',
  },
